---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Online Alcohol Detect"
  description="Terms and Conditions of service for Online Alcohol Detect. Please read our guidelines, usage terms, and full liability disclaimers."
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-canvas py-12 border-b border-hairline">
    <!-- Subtle Mesh Gradient Backdrop -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 select-none overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute top-[-20%] left-[-10%] w-[60%] h-[70%] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-gradient-develop-start to-gradient-develop-end blur-[120px] transform-gpu"></div>
      <div class="absolute top-[-30%] right-[-10%] w-[50%] h-[80%] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-bl from-gradient-preview-start to-gradient-preview-end blur-[140px] transform-gpu"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 text-center">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-pill bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline text-xs font-mono text-body mb-4 shadow-vercel-1">
        LEGAL INFORMATION
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-sans text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-1.5px] leading-[1.1] text-primary mb-4">
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-mute">
        Last updated: June 4, 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-canvas-soft">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-lg p-6 md:p-12 shadow-vercel-3">
        <div class="prose max-w-none text-body text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-6 font-sans">
          
          <p>
            Welcome to <strong>Online Alcohol Detect</strong>. By accessing and using our website (<a href="/" class="text-link hover:underline">alcoholdetect.com</a>), you agree to comply with and be bound by the following Terms and Conditions. Please review them carefully. If you do not agree to these terms, you should not use this website or its calculator.
          </p>

          <h2 class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-primary pt-4 border-b border-hairline pb-2">
            1. Informational & Educational Purposes Only
          </h2>
          <p class="font-medium text-primary">
            The calculations, countdowns, and graphs generated by the Online Alcohol Detect tool are mathematical estimations based on average biological models (specifically Watson's regression equations) and standard elimination rates. 
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>These estimations do <strong>not</strong> constitute medical, legal, or professional advice.</li>
            <li>Physical reactions to alcohol vary greatly based on factors like genetics, metabolic rate, food consumption, fatigue, medication, and overall health.</li>
            <li>This tool cannot predict exact individual blood chemistry and <strong>must never</strong> be used to decide if it is safe or legal to drive a vehicle, operate heavy machinery, or engage in any high-risk activity.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-primary pt-4 border-b border-hairline pb-2">
            2. Absolute Disclaimer of Warranties
          </h2>
          <p>
            This website and the calculator are provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind, either express or implied, including, but not limited to, warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement. We make no warranty that the calculator is 100% accurate, error-free, or will meet your requirements.
          </p>

          <h2 class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-primary pt-4 border-b border-hairline pb-2">
            3. Limitation of Liability & Release
          </h2>
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, in no event shall Online Alcohol Detect, its creators, developers, or affiliates be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of or related to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Your use of or reliance on the calculator, metrics, or graphs.</li>
            <li>Decisions made, including driving or operating machinery, based on calculations provided by the site.</li>
            <li>Any legal violations, arrests, fines, accidents, personal injuries, or fatalities connected to alcohol consumption.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            By using this website, you voluntarily release and forever discharge Online Alcohol Detect and its developers from any and all claims, liabilities, or demands.
          </p>

          <h2 class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-primary pt-4 border-b border-hairline pb-2">
            4. User License and Intellectual Property
          </h2>
          <p>
            Unless otherwise stated, Online Alcohol Detect and/or its licensors own the intellectual property rights for all material on this site. You may access this for your own personal, non-commercial use subject to restrictions set in these terms. You must not:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Republish material from Online Alcohol Detect without proper attribution.</li>
            <li>Sell, rent, or sub-license material from Online Alcohol Detect.</li>
            <li>Reproduce, duplicate, or copy code, layout elements, or content from this site for commercial purposes.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-primary pt-4 border-b border-hairline pb-2">
            5. Cookies & Advertising
          </h2>
          <p>
            By using this website, you consent to the use of cookies and data processing as outlined in our <a href="/privacy/" class="text-link hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>. We partner with third-party networks, including Google AdSense, to display ads. These networks may track cookies to serve customized ads.
          </p>

          <h2 class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-primary pt-4 border-b border-hairline pb-2">
            6. Changes to These Terms
          </h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to revise and modify these Terms and Conditions at any time without notice. By continuing to use this website, you agree to be bound by the current version of these terms.
          </p>

          <h2 class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-primary pt-4 border-b border-hairline pb-2">
            7. Governing Law
          </h2>
          <p>
            Any claim relating to Online Alcohol Detect shall be governed by the laws of the operating country, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
